locke-treatise-1.logic.r2: argue/scope: A1: read with the obligation on its consequent alone, end_continuation ∧ young_need_sustaining → O conj_lasts_while_needed, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, O(end_continuation ∧ young_need_sustaining → conj_lasts_while_needed), C (S3) does not follow: it needs the ought on the consequent alone (narrow scope), not only on the conditional (wide), and which the sentence means decides the argument
